{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>eXoSpace Combat Engineer</strong> is inspired by Reassembly, Nova Drift, FTL, Cosmoteer,  Starsector, Avorion and more. It fills a unique niche as a mission-based, <strong>gridless</strong> spaceship-designing bullet-hell<strong> </strong>shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/55d603f9fa732f243f1ca310a2353ae1.webp?t=1773153025\" width=370 height=32 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/b9b70dc2b38beb18136b735e194ddd88.poster.avif?t=1773153025\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/b9b70dc2b38beb18136b735e194ddd88.webm?t=1773153025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/b9b70dc2b38beb18136b735e194ddd88.mp4?t=1773153025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break free from the grid.</strong> Use an intuitive snap-and-rotate system to build anything from nimble interceptors to massive, bristling juggernauts. Balance thrusters, armor, and energy systems, or use advanced mechanical parts like <strong>pistons and rotators</strong> to create transforming warships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/27bc3584ca31be7f7e5efe34d47cd3be.webp?t=1773153025\" width=368 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/4980ed4642e5cedd331d04dc4047b2a8.poster.avif?t=1773153025\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/4980ed4642e5cedd331d04dc4047b2a8.webm?t=1773153025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/4980ed4642e5cedd331d04dc4047b2a8.mp4?t=1773153025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two hunts are the same.</strong> Each hyperjump brings randomized encounters, from desperate rescue missions to deadly pirate ambushes. Unleash destruction while evading enemy fire. Scavenge blueprints from fallen foes, gather resources, and adapt your ship\u2019s design on the fly to survive the next boss encounter.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/ed82b2d4d6f1d3c60a96a73538a0eab0.webp?t=1773153025\" width=323 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in deep space requires more than just a sturdy hull, it requires a seasoned crew and a tactical edge.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train Your Crew:</strong>\u00a0Use your bounty to train your crew. Improve weapon cooling, repair speeds, or pilot maneuvering, turning a rookie bridge into a legendary strike team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewrite the Rules:</strong>\u00a0Unlock <strong>Global Modifiers</strong> that fundamentally alter the physics and economy of the galaxy. Trade higher risks for massive rewards, or experiment with gameplay-altering shifts that keep every run fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb the Hit List:</strong> Progress through a hierarchy of increasingly dangerous targets. As your reputation grows, so does the bounty. prepare your ship for the galaxy's most feared supervillains.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>User Praise:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;This game feels like Reassembly if it was designed as a game, first and foremost, instead of a shipbuilding sandbox.&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cI like how here, I can quickly design something and experiment. I can iterate quickly and comfortably.&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThis game is ingenious, amazing and AWESOME! Something that fills the gap between Reassembly, Cosmoteer and Starsector.\u201d</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our community on Discord!</strong>\u00a0(link in the sidebar -&gt;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXoSpace is a passion project by Fantastimaker, an independent game studio consisting of just Bas, its developer, marketeer and designer.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2876200?t=1773153025","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/6b852a33270fecc97c030861ae6899337f8900fb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773153025","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/0c6cb0eb4c88ca735407ea4aee052f591ef724c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773153025","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/0c6cb0eb4c88ca735407ea4aee052f591ef724c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773153025","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3756720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>eXoSpace Combat Engineer</strong> is inspired by Reassembly, Nova Drift, FTL, Cosmoteer,  Starsector, Avorion and more. It fills a unique niche as a mission-based, <strong>gridless</strong> spaceship-designing bullet-hell<strong> </strong>shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/55d603f9fa732f243f1ca310a2353ae1.webp?t=1773153025\" width=370 height=32 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/b9b70dc2b38beb18136b735e194ddd88.poster.avif?t=1773153025\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/b9b70dc2b38beb18136b735e194ddd88.webm?t=1773153025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/b9b70dc2b38beb18136b735e194ddd88.mp4?t=1773153025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break free from the grid.</strong> Use an intuitive snap-and-rotate system to build anything from nimble interceptors to massive, bristling juggernauts. Balance thrusters, armor, and energy systems, or use advanced mechanical parts like <strong>pistons and rotators</strong> to create transforming warships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/27bc3584ca31be7f7e5efe34d47cd3be.webp?t=1773153025\" width=368 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ct