ng>Climb the Hit List:</strong> Progress through a hierarchy of increasingly dangerous targets. As your reputation grows, so does the bounty. prepare your ship for the galaxy's most feared supervillains.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>User Praise:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;This game feels like Reassembly if it was designed as a game, first and foremost, instead of a shipbuilding sandbox.&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cI like how here, I can quickly design something and experiment. I can iterate quickly and comfortably.&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThis game is ingenious, amazing and AWESOME! Something that fills the gap between Reassembly, Cosmoteer and Starsector.\u201d</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our community on Discord!</strong>\u00a0(link in the sidebar -&gt;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXoSpace is a passion project by Fantastimaker, an independent game studio consisting of just Bas, its developer, marketeer and designer.</p>","developers":["Fantastimaker"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/8a8f9a6293c9d25b0929a9a4a1df6d7ca8af7d6c/header.jpg?t=1773153025","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2025 Bas @ Fantastimaker","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</s